milies Donors School Counselors Give Deposit Now Request Info Visit Apply Search this website Close Section Menu Breen Center Alumni Employers Internships LVC Success Expo The Grad School Guide Advisory Committee Breen Center Goals, Functions, Activities, & Policies Staff Breen Center Home Breen Center for Career & Professional Development Wherever You Go, We’re with You All the Way Explore resources and see how the Breen Center is supporting career success: Students: Internship grants, student employment opportunities, scheduling career coaching appointments in LVC Bridge Forward Faculty: Class Integration Requests Alumni: Take advantage of Breen Center services for life. Employers: Get to know LVC students! For Students For Faculty For Employers Career & Professional Development at Your Fingertips Play Video Crafting Careers with Meaning The Breen Center for Career and Professional Development is one of LVC’s most powerful career readiness tools for students, wherever you are in your college journey. At the Breen Center you’ll find a dedicated team of experts who coach, counsel, and guide you to success in your chosen career. Contact The Breen Center Breen Center In Action Engage Achieve Play video Play video Play video Our Success Stories Soft Skills It’s not the subject-matter skills that advance you later in your career, it’s those other softer skills. Work ethic, teamwork, communication, and being a good mentor—those skills are much more important. Matt Vera ’90, chemist, federal government agency Experience The Breen Center was very helpful with my career search. They helped me set up a LinkedIn profile, which I used to get an internship this summer. Now, I have a job offer from my internship, and it all started with a drop-in visit to the Breen Center. Andy Loy ’23 Outcomes Students should take advantage of the Career Peers service and other networking opportunities the Breen Center hosts. Their Accounting Night led to my summer internship. Leah Wingert ’21 