equest Info Visit Apply Search this website Close Section Menu Admitted Students Admitted Student Checklist Financial Aid Reminders for Enrolled Students How to Pay Your Deposit LVC LIVE New Student Advising New Student Orientation Week of Welcome Admitted Graduate Students How to Pay Your Deposit Home Admission & Aid Admitted Students How to Pay Your Deposit We’re excited that you’re ready to enroll at Lebanon Valley College! Your $200 enrollment deposit* can be paid online with a credit card, by mail with a check, and in person with a check or cash. Pay Online Log in to your application portal to submit your enrollment deposit. Pay Deposit Online Pay by mail Make check payable to Lebanon Valley College. Send your non-refundable enrollment deposit to: Office of Admission Lebanon Valley College 101 North College Ave Annville, PA 17003 Please do not mail credit card information to the Admission Office. If you wish to pay by credit card, please select Pay Online. Pay in person If you live locally or will be visiting campus, checks (payable to Lebanon Valley College) and cash may be brought to our Business Office located in the Humanities building on College Avenue. Business hours are Monday through Friday, 8 a.m. to 4:30 p.m. *The enrollment deposit is non-refundable. 101 N. College Avenue Annville, PA 17003-1400 1-717-867-6100 Campus Maps & Directions Where to Park Working at LVC LVC Online Bookstore LVC Gear Shop Academic Calendar Bishop Library The Suzanne H. Arnold Gallery Offices & Directories MyLVC LVC LinkedIn LVC Facebook LVC Instagram LVC TikTok Policies & Legal Notices Consumer Information Translate © 2026 Lebanon Valley College"
